WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.867
Set up or change a maintenance plan.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:09.233
New plan. Starts a plan for a customer (a customer's page can start one too).

00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:16.300
Pick the customer. Type a name, phone or street and click the customer; the plan form opens.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.000
Close the form. The x closes it without starting a plan.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.033
Open a plan. An existing plan opens in the same form. Let's open one.

00:00:27.533 --> 00:00:31.800
Service. What the plan is, e.g. Weekly lawn care.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:38.000
From the catalogue. Click a catalogue item to fill in the service name and its price.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:48.867
How often. Weekly, every 2 weeks, monthly, quarterly, spring + fall, or Snow (on call: add a visit when it snows; pricing is on the Snow screen).

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:51.967
Crew. The crew that does the visits.

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:56.367
Day of the week. The day the visits fall on, or Any.

00:00:56.867 --> 00:01:03.667
Season. Season from and to; the strip under it shows the months. No visits outside the season.

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:08.867
Start and end. When the plan starts, and an end date if it has one.

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:15.167
Crew-hours a visit. How long a visit takes. It counts against the crew's day on the board.

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:19.233
Price. The price per visit, or the monthly fee.

00:01:19.733 --> 00:01:26.367
Billing. Each finished visit (billed at month end), a fixed monthly fee in season, or not billed here.

00:01:26.867 --> 00:01:32.300
Note for the crew. Gate code, dog, what to skip … It shows on the crew's phone.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:40.700
Tell the customer. Emails the customer the date of the first visit. Handy for cleanups; leave it off for weekly mowing.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:46.967
Next visits. The next dates the plan will book. They change as you change the settings.

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:50.833
Booked visits. Visits already on the schedule.

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:55.667
Move a visit. Move puts a visit on another day (a rain day).

00:01:56.167 --> 00:02:01.300
Skip a visit. Skip drops that visit; it stays skipped and won't come back.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:08.333
Save the plan. Save plan (Create plan for a new one) books its visits. The tour doesn't press it.

00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:13.900
Pause. Pause takes the future visits off; Resume brings the plan back.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:21.367
End the plan. Future visits come off the schedule; finished visits can still be billed. It asks first.

00:02:21.867 --> 00:02:26.533
Close the form. The x closes the form without saving anything.

00:02:27.033 --> 00:02:32.633
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
